NPCs: {
	FarSeaEarlNPC.DisplayName: Far Sea Earl

	JinlianNPC: {
		DisplayName: Jin Lian
		TownNPCDialogueName: Jin Lian
		ButtonFollow: Follow
		ButtonStopFollow: Stop Following
		GiftLine1: Finding me must be a real hassle, running all over the world.
		GiftLine2: Here, take this little jellyfish. Pat it whenever you need me.
		GiftCaption: Item received
		InventoryFull: Inventory is full, the item was not picked up.
		ButtonRecall: Recall
		ButtonClose: Close
		IntroWho: Who are you?
		IntroLineIdentity: Let me introduce myself. I am the Far Sea Earl, though you may call me Jinlian.
		UnknownName: ???
		ButtonHeal: Heal
		ButtonShop: Shop
		ShopTitle: Wines of the Dust Sea
		ShopCategoryAlcohol: Wines
		ShopNotEnoughMoney: You cannot afford that.
		ShopBought: Item purchased!
		ShopUnitGold: gold
		ShopUnitSilver: silver
		ShopUnitCopper: copper
		FirstReviveLine1: You can actually command the dust tree's life force?
		FirstReviveLine2: Then you may be blessed. Do you feel anything?
		FirstReviveOptionBlessing: What blessing? How would I know?
		FirstReviveLine3: The old tree seems rather fond of you. Did you not feel warm standing beside it?
		FirstReviveLine4: And your wounds will heal faster as well.
		FirstReviveLine5: You really are something, you.
		HealLine1: A miracle worker!
		HealLine2: So warm.
		HealLine3: I should not get hurt again.
		HealLine4: Good as new!
		HealLine5: Just a scratch.
		HealLine6: You are getting good at this.
		ButtonRevive: Revive
		DeathTitle: Jinlian is dead
		RevivePrompt: My soul is still drifting over the dust sea.
		ReviveLine1: The underworld would not take me. My task is unfinished. Now that I live, this debt is not settled.
		ReviveHint: The dust tree's power wove a body and welcomed the wandering soul.
		RecallPrompt: What do you need from me?
		RecallReady: I am in position.
		RecallMissing: I have not arrived in this world yet.
		ChatTextFollow: Let's go.
		ChatTextStopFollow: All right.
		ChatTextDaily1: When we investigate, use my title~
		ChatTextDaily2: Are you watching as well?
		ChatTextDaily3: In the name of the ocean, I command you... just kidding~
		ChatTextDaily4: You will not even call me Earl once?
		ChatTextDaily5: Waves are content on their own, why bind them to life?
		ChatTextDaily6: The ocean is higher than the sky, you know that, right?
		ChatTextDaily7: The only problem is... how the other eleven get a cowboy hat too.
		IntroLine1: So you came after all...
		IntroAsk: Is there something you need?
		IntroLine2: The ocean holds much life, and it should.
		IntroLine3: But anything overdone turns against itself. Too much vitality has broken the balance of the ocean.
		IntroLine4: Will you help me investigate this? This surge of ocean vitality.
		IntroOptionAgree: Fine. As for what happened before... let us call it even.
		IntroOptionReward: What is in it for me?
		IntroOptionBlame: You are asking for my help, so why did you attack me?
		Continue: Continue
		Accept: All right, you have my word.
		IntroAnswerAgree: Truly? I cannot thank you enough!
		IntroAnswerReward1: Surely you would not want this land overgrown with trees that hit people.
		IntroAnswerReward2: I will give you a fitting reward afterwards.
		IntroAnswerBlame1: Did you not summon me?
		IntroAnswerBlame2: That was... ah... a test. You proved you are strong, did you not!
		IntroAnswerBlame3: I will reward you.

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I'm quite content.
			NoHome: I hate not having a home.
			FarFromHome: I'm too far from home.
			LoveSpace: I love how spacious it is here.
			DislikeCrowded: I don't like how crowded it is.
			HateCrowded: I hate how crowded it is.
			LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}.
			Princess_LovesNPC: I like {NPCName}.
		}
	}
}

